    'man.join.what':'A meeting point for two branches. Wire each Model\'s result with item into left reading or right reading. Join matches the same observation, even if other items arrive between its two readings. It reports agreement or disagreement only when both readings are confident. Missing, unread or unsure results go to needs review. It keeps the original reference answer for a later Evaluator. A fresh Run clears all waiting pairs. Up to 64 items can wait and 4096 can finish per Run; slow a source if it fills.',
