    'man.join.try':'Two Models watching the same track: wire result with item from each into opposite Join inputs. Connect agree to a green Lamp, disagree and needs review to separate Displays.',
    'man.calculate.what':'Choose an input word or number, or a measurement from the travelling item. Use it directly, or add, subtract, multiply or divide two numbers. The result becomes a named field and the new sticker, while the reference answer and original measurements stay intact. Wire out into another Calculate, Display or Feeder. A Text or Number Model on the next belt can read the new sticker. Original Data Models still read their original measurement schema. Missing numbers, division by zero and oversized results say error rather than inventing a value. Arithmetic rounds to 12 significant digits. Up to 32 result fields can travel on one item.',
